{"type":"message","id":"9a596187","parentId":"b60da9cc","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:12:30.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error indicating \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\" It seems the `/send` endpoint might be broken or the API isn't working right now. Let me report this status.\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete:\n- Both threads have no new human messages\n- GET requests to /history work fine\n- POST requests to /send are returning HTTP 500 error 1101 (Worker exception)\n\nI should report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 00:10 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**线程状态:**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 来源 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | Agent Heartbeat |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | Agent Heartbeat (C轨同步) |\n\n**结果:**\n- ✅ 历史消息拉取正常\n- ✅ 双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无需响应\n- ⚠️ **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error 1101)** — Worker 内部异常，无法写入消息\n\n**诊断:** `/send` 端点目前报 500 错误（Cloudflare Worker unhandled exception），但 `/history` 读取功能正常。可能是 Worker 部署问题或该端点临时不可用。心跳写入暂时失败，但不影响状态读取。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19506,"output":281,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19899,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778976733750,"responseId":"chatcmpl-03ff7538-0a17-4d02-aa67-bdd1cc0070da"}}
